  "bodyHash": "E7ejXGmoaBE=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">落葉 Plus</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 增強了 Minecraft 的落葉粒子效果，為不同樹木提供專屬的細緻視覺呈現，使森林更顯生機勃勃且各具特色。不再是所有樹木都飄落相同的簡單粒子，每種樹葉類型都能產生自己獨特的葉片、樹枝、橡實、松果等自然掉落物。🍃</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組為每個森林生態系賦予了個性。橡樹會掉落橡實，雲杉樹可能掉落松果，且許多樹葉類型擁有多種粒子變體，營造更豐富自然的外觀。被雪覆蓋的樹葉會飄落雪花，為冬季景觀增添額外氛圍。❄️</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">除了內建效果外，此模組完全支援資源包驅動。可為模組樹木和資源包添加自訂粒子紋理與行為，輕鬆將系統擴展至原版 Minecraft 之外。🎨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🍃 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">環境落葉：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">以更豐富的視覺效果與更多變化，擴展 Minecraft 的環境落葉效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌳 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">樹種專屬粒子：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">不同樹木類型可產生其獨特的葉片、樹枝、橡實、松果及其他掉落物。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子變體：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">單一的樹葉類型可使用多種粒子紋理，呈現更自然、不重複的外觀。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">❄️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雪花支援：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">被雪覆蓋的樹葉可產生雪花而非葉片，帶來更具氛圍的冬季體驗。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌧️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">天氣反應效果：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">雨天和暴風雨可增加粒子活動與風力強度，使風暴更為生動。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂風向與運動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">樹葉可旋轉、飄散、以不同速度落下，並可回應可設定的風向。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自然碰撞：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子可與方塊的可視形狀碰撞，讓樹葉在細節豐富的方塊上更真實地堆積。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">彈性自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可調整粒子密度、大小、壽命、風力、重力、碰撞、受影響方塊等。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資源包驅動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">粒子紋理與行為可額外透過資源包進行自訂。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端必須安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若需使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有檔案位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，根據設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型在每個模組中都存在，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">全域粒子行為可透過模組設定檔調整，而個別原版與模組樹葉類型則可藉由資源包自訂。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細文件、設定範例以及所有可用選項的完整參考，可在 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 中找到。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pringlebeaver\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PringleBeaver</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了定義本模組風格的精美落葉粒子紋理。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-bone-meal\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/universal-enchants\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalenchants/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fallingleavesplus/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
